          "sizeGB": 40,
          "notes": "Same ~40 GB of official pruned INT8 weights as the MiniMax H3 pack, streamed through system RAM. Reference Video 1 is the clip to continue and is required; it should be an H3 clip at 24 fps (any SimpliGen H3 output). Spectrum is deliberately off: step-skipping mispredicts the pinned rows, which never change. Measured 2x5 s at 672x384, 20 steps: 411 s total, picture join ratio 1.90 against 16 for a hard cut, colour shift under 1/255 per channel (the pinned tail is sliced from the latent, so less drift than the pixel-path presets), steady audio across the join. Segment continuity pins the last 22 frames of segment 1 into segment 2 and trims them. Not tested above 2 segments; the Director supports more."
